div.p:
Dear ${object.manager_id.name or 'Manager'},


A new transport request has been submitted for your approval.


Request Details:

Reference: ${object.reference}

Requester: ${object.requester_id.name}

Date Required: ${object.date_required}

Destination: ${object.destination}

Purpose: ${object.purpose}


Please review and approve the request in the system.


Best regards,

Fleet Management System

An incident has been reported:


Incident Details:

Case Reference: ${object.reference}

Incident Type: ${dict(object._fields['incident_type'].selection).get(object.incident_type)}

Vehicle: ${object.vehicle_id.name} (${object.license_plate})

Incident Date: ${object.incident_date}

Location: ${object.incident_location}

Reported By: ${object.reported_by_id.name}


Immediate action may be required.


Best regards,

Fleet Management System

A vehicle accident has been reported:


Accident Details:

Reference: ${object.reference}

Vehicle: ${object.vehicle_id.name} (${object.vehicle_registration})

Driver: ${object.driver_id.name}

Accident Date: ${object.accident_date}

Location: ${object.accident_location}

Accident Type: ${dict(object._fields['accident_type'].selection).get(object.accident_type)}

Severity: ${dict(object._fields['severity_level'].selection).get(object.severity_level) if object.severity_level else 'Not Assessed'}

Injuries: ${object.total_injuries} person(s)


Reported By: ${object.reported_by_id.name}


Immediate Actions Required:

- Ensure safety of all involved

- Contact emergency services if needed

- Secure the accident scene

- Document with photos

- Complete full investigation


Best regards,

Fleet Management System

Dear ${object.requester_id.name},


Your vehicle relief request has been approved.


Relief Details:

Reference: ${object.reference}

Original Vehicle: ${object.original_registration}

Relief Reason: ${dict(object._fields['relief_reason'].selection).get(object.relief_reason)}

Start Date: ${object.start_date}

Expected End Date: ${object.expected_end_date}

Relief Vehicle: ${object.relief_registration if object.relief_vehicle_id else 'To Be Assigned'}


Approved By: ${object.approved_by_id.name}

Approval Date: ${object.approval_date}


Please coordinate with the fleet department for vehicle handover.


Best regards,

Fleet Management System
